# Polliwallop (CR 702.41a, 120.3, 609.7): "Affinity for Frogs. Target creature you control deals damage equal to twice its power to target
# creature you don't control." Bot1 controls two Frogs (Poison Dart Frog, Burrog Befuddler), so the {3}{G} spell costs {1}{G}: two Moxen pay it
# exactly (the pool is empty after the cast). The first target must be Bot1's (Bot2's Ornithopter is refused, the 1/1 Poison Dart Frog
# is chosen), the second Bot2's (Bot1's Befuddler is refused, Bot2's Ornithopter chosen). The Frog has power 1, so it deals twice that:
# 2, which kills the 0/2 Ornithopter (1 would not); the Frog takes nothing back.

